96,east,"To complete the task of reaching the stairs down, I will methodically explore the level, utilizing the 'search' command frequently to uncover hidden doors or secret passages. Given my current position near the stairs up, I will first explore the uncharted dark areas to the west and southwest. If I encounter any doors, I will use the 'open' command to pass through them. I will also be prepared to handle any enemies with my bullwhip. Since I've already explored the area to the east and found the stairs up, my priority will be to move west and then south to explore the dark areas, potentially finding the stairs down or other important features. I will continue this process, adjusting my direction as necessary based on new observations, until I find the stairs down.","message:


